WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:08.140
He continued war against a 79 year old infectious
disease doctor who has worked for six presidents

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.140
continues.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.770
I'm talking about Dr. Anthony Foushee continues
to be the target of protesters.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.720
Remember a couple of weeks ago, a chant of
fire.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.350
Foushee broke out at one of these reopened
protests.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:27.240
Here's the audio and video reminder of that.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:33.770
Well, it's getting even worse.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:39.620
They're going from fire foushee now to signs
that say hang foushee, hang foushee.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.770
Those have started to pop pop up at protests.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:48.370
Here's one from a Long Island, New York protest
over the weekend which says Hang foushee,

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:51.460
hang gates, open up all our states.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.850
Very poetic, very nice rhyming, but completely
horrifying.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:01:01.420
Hang Gates, of course, refers to Bill Gates,
who's donating huge sums of his own money

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.100
to find a vaccine.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.889
He's being regularly attacked for it.

00:01:04.889 --> 00:01:08.969
He's at the center of multiple conspiracy
theories, arguing that his intentions are

00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:10.719
actually nefarious.

00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:15.469
Will there actually be any accountability
for the conspiracy theorists that have spent

00:01:15.469 --> 00:01:17.719
months spreading this nonsense?

00:01:17.719 --> 00:01:22.090
Because this is a complete backslide from
just basic enlightenment values.

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:27.289
Now, I want to be careful because some of
these enlightened centrists and so-called

00:01:27.289 --> 00:01:32.060
classical liberals, they love to fetishize
talking about enlightenment values.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:38.130
And then they argue wildly that the left on
Twitter is falling back from enlightenment

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.819
values by trying to do things to prevent hate
speech or whatever.

00:01:41.819 --> 00:01:42.819
We don't do that here.

00:01:42.819 --> 00:01:43.819
OK.

00:01:43.819 --> 00:01:45.770
I don't know the last time I mentioned enlightenment
values.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.439
This is not something I've discussed that
much before.

00:01:48.439 --> 00:01:53.799
But the anti-science cesspool that has become
the corona virus protests.

00:01:53.799 --> 00:02:00.450
It actually is a fight against basic enlightenment
values of rationalist philosophy.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:05.499
Our respective science not fetishizing science,
just a respect for the scientific process

00:02:05.499 --> 00:02:09.149
and what it provides us respect of the law.

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:12.250
Importantly, so much of what we now take for
granted.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.019
Consider that the terrorists don't have to
attack us anymore.

00:02:16.019 --> 00:02:17.019
Why would they?

00:02:17.019 --> 00:02:22.610
We are destroying ourselves from the inside
as this battle has been created between those

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:28.270
who understand and respect the scientific
process and who understand what is an expert.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:34.560
This is not about phony experts, but actually
the difference between Dr. Anthony Foushee

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:37.030
and some guy on the internet with a blog.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:38.030
Right.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:44.000
And those who peddle conspiracies and mass
gather believe that they know better than

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.819
actual doctors.

00:02:45.819 --> 00:02:51.060
This is not the crisis of expertise, which
is something I've not been shy about covering.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:58.499
Imagine the same people rightly criticizing
the signs and the chants of death to America

00:02:58.499 --> 00:03:00.409
elsewhere in the world.

00:03:00.409 --> 00:03:07.320
They are the same ones who chant Fire foushee
and hold up signs that say Hang Foushee, we're

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.590
doing the job of the terrorists for them.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:15.870
I would even go further when it comes to the
country being united against the common enemy.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:20.530
After 9/11, Americans were, by and large,
briefly united.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.530
Very united.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:26.470
It didn't last that long because George W.
Bush turned 9/11 into a war against Iraq,

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.380
which had nothing to do with 9/11 at all.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:33.709
But there was a period there, the end of 2001
when George W. Bush went to the rubble at

00:03:33.709 --> 00:03:35.069
Ground Zero.

00:03:35.069 --> 00:03:36.629
His approval rating spiked.

00:03:36.629 --> 00:03:39.120
I think it was 86 or even 90 percent.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.950
In late 2001.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.470
And the country was united.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.659
This could have happened with coronavirus.

00:03:45.659 --> 00:03:47.120
I've said it before.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:53.810
If on March 5th, Trump makes an FDR like speech,
I'm not endorsing everything FDR did.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:59.080
OK, so before you even start sending me messages
about that, but an FDR like speech where he

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:02.439
speaks to the nation and says we have difficult
times ahead.

00:04:02.439 --> 00:04:03.730
We do.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:09.040
The economics are going to be tough for a
little while, but we must come together.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:13.719
We need stay at home from 50 governors for
60 days.

00:04:13.719 --> 00:04:16.709
You know, maybe at that time it would've been
30 and then it ends up getting extended for

00:04:16.709 --> 00:04:17.709
30.

00:04:17.709 --> 00:04:19.699
We're going to come out on the other side.

00:04:19.699 --> 00:04:22.310
We are going to come out with few deaths.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:25.220
We will start to reopen and rebuild.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.069
That ship sailed.

00:04:27.069 --> 00:04:34.180
But with it also sailed, the administration
may be presiding over a rational reaction.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:40.990
Instead, we've seen Donald Trump sort of coyly
says support the protesters, drawing a line

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:45.840
in the sand, separating his view from that
of the scientists, criticizing everybody under

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:51.821
the sun about his own mishandling from Obama
to governors to Democrats, whoever else, while

00:04:51.821 --> 00:04:54.139
lying about testing and everything else.

00:04:54.139 --> 00:04:56.110
This doesn't bode well for our future.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.380
Other countries are realizing it.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:02.360
I told you that their laughter has mostly
turned to horror and pity at this point.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:13.241
And I don't know how we dig out 
of it.

00:05:13.241 --> 00:06:18.770
My friends, I really don't.

